PROGRAM-ID. HELLO-DOCUP.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(4) VALUE 1000.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "PROCESSING BATCH: " WS-COUNT.
    STOP RUN.
!}

